        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.21457">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2508.21457">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2508.21457">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
